  "description": "Identifies and flags maintenance work orders at risk, such as those that are past due or have incomplete resource assignments, within the specified date range. Highlights at-risk work orders and provides actionable risk visibility for supervisors. Also supports setting or switching the organization context by extracting it from user queries.",
