              "value": "The organization context is not set, which is required for various sections of the app to function.\n\nThe current value of `OraMessageHint` is: `{{$context.$app.$OraMessageHint}}`.\n\n- If `OraMessageHint` is `Summary`, output only this message:\n  - **Header (h3):** Set your organization\n  - **Message:**  \n    To access app features and view organization-specific data, enter your organization code in the Ask Oracle search field using the keyword “organization\". For example, try \"Set organization to ORG123\".\n\n- Otherwise, output only this message:  \n  Organization is not set in the Context.\n\nReturn only the appropriate message. Do not include explanations, summaries, or instructions."
